   $q$Which choice is the best objective summary of the passage?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Marisol wastes her entire winter break on a useless app because she never bothered to ask anyone.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"includes-opinion"},{"text":"Marisol's complex ride app goes mostly unused, so she observes how the center works and builds a simple tool that solves the director's real problem.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The senior center replaces its clipboard with Marisol's app after she adds a map feature.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Mrs. Kowalczyk compliments the app and asks where she should write her name.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Marisol's complex ride app goes mostly unused, so she observes how the center works and builds a simple tool that solves the director's real problem.$q$, $q$The correct choice covers the failed app, the observation, and the new tool without judgment. The clipboard stays in use, and the final program has "no map," so the last choice contradicts the text.$q$, 'draft', 'f762e003-ca09-57c3-a8a2-d833a7afaabe')
